  (global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 256.54 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "290a7bad-e2e9-526a-baf5-69a52f80e451")
    (property "Intersheetrefs" "" (at 256.54 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common (VLOAD) feeds the timer, the counter and the LEDs. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 150.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af7a18df-2d60-5124-980e-d55ca71a2724"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 153.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b6351e6a-ebf5-5642-8313-dc3698edb89b"))
  (text "Nothing is wired to SDA, SCL, GPIO1 or GPIO2 (as in the maker's schematic), so no series diode is needed on the cell (docs/standard.md section 3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 157.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ecc6ae50-f37c-57e5-a1d4-0f3d973f1c7d"))
  (text "The maker's circuit: a 555 astable (U1) clocks a 4017 decade counter (U2). Exactly one of Q0..Q9 is high at any time, so one LED is lit and the light steps D1, D2 ... D10, D1 ..." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 164.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "147fd78b-9d13-539e-bf43-969d61a3b03f"))
  (text "U1: R1 (with R4, R5) = RA from VLOAD to DIS, R2 = RB from DIS to THR/TRIG, C2 = timing capacitor, C1 on the control pin, RESET tied high. U2: clock enable (/CP1) and reset (MR) tied low, carry output unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 167.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "20ba1012-35b4-573b-ae24-9f5a2f059be0"))
  (text "Maker's values: 220k, 220 ohm, 0.47 uF = 13.9 steps a second. Here: three 3.3M in parallel (1.1M), 330 ohm, 100 nF = 13.1 steps a second, using only parts SAO++ already stocks. Fit one or two of R1/R4/R5 for 4.4 or 8.7 steps a second." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 171.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "77a788ce-e7e3-5a89-8017-931c0ccf2a0d"))
  (text "R3 is the maker's one shared LED resistor (470 ohm in his drawing; the house 1.3k here: about 1 mA). His drawing has every LED the wrong way round (cathode to the counter); the LEDs here conduct from counter output to R3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 175.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8fb5e10c-7834-55b9-9fc6-95d3cb007445"))
  (text "U1 is an LMC555 (the NE555 in the maker's drawing needs 4.5 V). U2 must be a 74HC4017 (2 V to 6 V), not a CD4017 (3 V minimum). C3 = supply capacitor (not in the maker's drawing)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 179.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e431adfb-54a3-5597-8437-45b989085ad6"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
